Inspect an asynchronous operation

Usage: xrm operation [OPTIONS] [SUBCOMMAND]

OPTIONS:
  -h,   --help            Show this help message 

SUBCOMMANDS:
  get                     Read an operation's final result 

GLOBAL OPTIONS (before the command):
        --socket PATH     xrmd Unix domain socket 
        --json            Write machine readable output 
        --verbose         Include original diagnostics in human errors 

Examples:
  xrm operation get --help

Next: xrm operation <command> --help
